sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RM as Retail Manager
    participant UI as Web Client
    participant API as Express Server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2
    participant Worker as Python AI Worker

    Note over RM, Worker: 1. Registration & Login
    RM->>UI: Fill registration form & submit
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/register
    API->>DB: Insert user (hasUsedFreeTrial = false)
    API-->>UI: 201 User registered successfully

    RM->>UI: Enter email & password to login
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Verify email, password & active status
    API-->>UI: 200 Return JWT token & user info

    Note over RM, Worker: 2. First-Time Upload (Free Quota <= 75MB)
    RM->>UI: Select CSV file & click Upload
    UI->>API: POST /api/datasets/upload (CSV)
    API->>DB: Check active subscription & hasUsedFreeTrial
    Note right of DB: No active sub & hasUsedFreeTrial == false\nGrants 75MB one-time free quota
    API->>R2: Upload CSV file to storage
    API->>DB: Set hasUsedFreeTrial = true & insert dataset
    API->>Worker: POST /analyze (dataset_id)
    API-->>UI: 200 File uploaded & analysis started

    Note over RM, Worker: 3. Second Upload Attempt (Fails - Free Quota Exhausted)
    RM->>UI: Select another CSV file & click Upload
    UI->>API: POST /api/datasets/upload (CSV)
    API->>DB: Check active subscription & hasUsedFreeTrial
    Note right of DB: No active sub & hasUsedFreeTrial == true
    API-->>UI: 402 Payment Required (Free trial exhausted)
    UI-->>RM: Show upgrade prompt & "Trial Used" status
